      },
      "text": "## The Balancing Equation as a Dynamical System"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#002",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    POPULATION CHANGE MECHANICS                              │\n│                                                                             │\n│  P(t+1) = P(t) + B(t) − D(t) + IM(t) − EM(t)                                │\n│                                                                             │\n│  Components:                                                                │\n│  B(t)  = Births in period t → t+1        determined by ASFR × women_x       │\n│  D(t)  = Deaths in period t → t+1        determined by ASDR × N_x           │\n│  IM(t) = In-migrants in period            driven by econ/political forces   │\n│  EM(t) = Out-migrants in period           selective, age/skill-structured   │\n│                                                                             │\n│  NATURAL INCREASE:  NI = B − D                                              │\n│  NET MIGRATION:     NM = IM − EM                                            │\n│  GROWTH:            ΔP = NI + NM                                            │\n│                                                                             │\n│  Population growth rate: r = ΔP/P = (NI + NM)/P                             │\n│  ≈ CBR − CDR + Net migration rate                                           │\n│                                                                             │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#003",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Continuous form (closed population, no migration):\n  dP/dt = (b(t) − d(t)) × P(t)\n  where b(t) = birth rate per person, d(t) = death rate per person"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#004",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "If b − d = r is constant:\n  P(t) = P(0) × e^{rt}\n  Exponential growth (Malthusian model)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Doubling time: t₂ = ln(2)/r ≈ 0.693/r\n  r = 0.03 (3% growth) → t₂ ≈ 23 years\n  r = 0.01 (1% growth) → t₂ ≈ 69 years  (Rule of 70)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
