      },
      "text": "## Rates — Crude vs. Age-Specific"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCRUDE BIRTH RATE (CBR):\n  CBR = B / P_mid × 1000\n  P_mid = midyear population\n  Units: live births per 1,000 population per year\n  Typical range: 8-15 (low fertility countries) to 35-50 (high fertility countries)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CRUDE DEATH RATE (CDR):\n  CDR = D / P_mid × 1000\n  Typical range: 6-10 (most countries) to 15+ (extremely old or high-mortality populations)\n  Paradox: CDR often LOW in high-mortality LMICs because age structure is young\n  Japan CDR > Bangladesh CDR even though Japanese health is far better"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RATE OF NATURAL INCREASE (RNI):\n  RNI = (CBR − CDR) / 1000\n  = proportional annual growth from natural increase only\n  Global 2023: CBR ≈ 17.7, CDR ≈ 7.7 → RNI ≈ 1.0%"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AGE-SPECIFIC DEATH RATE (ASDR):\n  ASDR_x = D_x / N_x × 1000\n  where D_x = deaths at age x, N_x = population at age x"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:demography:01-population-dynamics, git-history:demography:01-population-dynamics]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "current_path": "demography/01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-dynamics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, dynamics]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Dynamics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AGE-SPECIFIC FERTILITY RATE (ASFR):\n  ASFR_x = B_x / W_x × 1000\n  where B_x = births to women aged x, W_x = women aged x\n  Summed across reproductive ages (15-49) → General Fertility Rate\n  Weighted appropriately → TFR (see 02-FERTILITY)\n```"
    },
    {
